    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">The high-end luxury car is not only the supreme example of an automobile, it is also an inspiring muse for the creativity and skills of designers and engineers of mass-market vehicles, and the dream of all enthusiasts. Not a year passes without a new award-winning supercar being released. And it matters little whether it is a One-Off, a specimen just for the few, or for many but not for all, or an Instant Classic. The images and text in this volume recount the stories of the most important supercars of the last decade. It gives a well-rounded review of the great cars of the past decade and will arouse the emotions of every car enthusiast.</marc:subfield>
